  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Peace and Justice in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon hosts the largest number of refugees per capita in the world and is coping with a consistent influx of refugees fleeing the conflicts in the region. In addition, there are increased concerns with regard to reported criminal activity such as smuggling and trafficking along the border. UNOPS supports the winter training centre construction for the land border regiments.</narrative>
